# Trial of Knowledge with a test bot. Two wrong answers: expect correct=3, passed=false.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotKnoF
@sleep 2
kill TtlBotKnoF
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl wish knowledge
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl trial
@sleep 3
ttl inspect TtlBotKnoF
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl answer slime
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl answer predator
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl answer magicules
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl answer church
execute as TtlBotKnoF run ttl answer footsteps
@sleep 2
ttl inspect TtlBotKnoF
ttl reset TtlBotKnoF
ttlbot remove TtlBotKnoF
